OL,3,GNEWSAWitnesses sought after shooting in
OL,4,Afront of crowd
OL,5,
OL,6,FKey witnesses at a memorial service
OL,7,Fduring which a man was fatally shot in
OL,8,Fthe chest have been urged to speak to
OL,9,Fthe police.
OL,11,FLevi Davidson, 40, from west London,
OL,12,Fwas at the gathering in East Acton on 2
OL,13,FOctober when he was shot outside in
OL,14,Ffront of a crowd of between 50 and 70
OL,15,Fadults and children, the Met Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
