OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWitnesses sought after shooting in
OL,4,Afront of crowd
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives have released CCTV images of
OL,7,Findividuals they want to identify and
OL,8,Fspeak to about the shooting as
OL,9,Fwitnesses, and Crimestoppers is
OL,10,Foffering a reward of #20,000 for anyone
OL,11,Fwho provides information to the charity
OL,12,Fthat leads to the killer's prosecution.
OL,14,FDet Ch Insp Brian Howie said he
OL,15,Fbelieved witnesses held "crucial
OL,16,Finformation" about the shooting. No
OL,17,Farrests have been made.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
